WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.579
All experiments run on a synthetic tabular Markov
decision process with fifteen states

00:00:05.659 --> 00:00:08.079
plus a terminal state and six actions,

00:00:08.159 --> 00:00:11.238
using a discount factor of zero point nine five.

00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:13.936
The true dynamics are deliberately mixed,

00:00:14.016 --> 00:00:18.278
sometimes uniform and sometimes highly skewed
toward a few states,

00:00:18.358 --> 00:00:20.581
to create rich and varied behavior.

00:00:20.661 --> 00:00:22.555
We study two coverage regimes,

00:00:22.635 --> 00:00:27.819
a low data setting of fifteen episodes and a high
data setting of three hundred,

00:00:27.899 --> 00:00:32.491
crossed with three levels of expert optimality that
create zero, three,

00:00:32.571 --> 00:00:34.597
and six uncertain policy states.

00:00:34.677 --> 00:00:40.190
Every reported number is averaged over one thousand
independently generated datasets.
